Description: unified appearance theme controller for Axionis Cinnamon
 Axionis Theme Manager applies declarative bundles containing coordinated GTK,
 Cinnamon, icon, cursor, wallpaper, lock-screen, and appearance preferences.
 It provides an XApp GUI and a machine-readable CLI for automation and agents.
